WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.778
If you want to keep check-in times, open
Settings, then Notifications, and turn on
Shift check-ins.

00:00:07.928 --> 00:00:10.250
Go back to Today and find the shift you're
starting.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.808
Tap Check in when you begin.

00:00:15.658 --> 00:00:17.708
That saves the time from this device.

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:20.632
When you finish, tap Check out.

00:00:21.532 --> 00:00:24.636
Checking out records a time, but it doesn't
mark the shift as worked.

00:00:25.836 --> 00:00:27.996
Make that attendance choice on Today
separately.

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:32.886
If a time needs correcting, open the
shift's notes and check-in record.

00:00:33.736 --> 00:00:38.331
Keep the time you actually worked, rather
than leaving a mistaken tap as the record.
